@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = Pega_aqui_el_token_de_login
@transactionId = 1

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Registrar cuenta (elimina este bloque si ya existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "estudiante@example.com",
  "password": "UnaClaveSegura123"
}

### Iniciar sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "estudiante@example.com",
  "password": "UnaClaveSegura123"
}

### Crear gasto
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almuerzo",
  "amount": 8500,
  "category": "Comida",
  "spent_on": "2026-10-03"
}

### Listar y filtrar gastos
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?month=2026-10&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar gasto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almuerzo actualizado",
  "amount": 9000,
  "category": "Comida",
  "spent_on": "2026-10-03"
}

### Eliminar gasto
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Caso que debe fallar: intento de inyección en la categoría (400 por validación)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Prueba de seguridad",
  "amount": 1,
  "category": "Comida' OR 1=1 --",
  "spent_on": "2026-10-03"
}

### Caso que debe fallar: petición privada sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Caso que debe fallar: monto inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Monto negativo",
  "amount": -50,
  "category": "Comida",
  "spent_on": "2026-10-03"
}
